Package: styio-ide
Version: 0.1.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24), liblzma5 (>= 5.4), libblkid1 (>= 2.38)
Recommends: chromium, clang, cmake, ninja-build, pkg-config
Maintainer: Styio IDE Team
Description: Styio IDE -- Language-first development environment
 Styio IDE is a language-first IDE built on the Styio language ecosystem.
 It provides a native Flutter desktop shell, handwritten web IDE
 prototype, and a modular extension and contribution model.
 .
 This package provides the Linux native Flutter desktop build.
